            @spec.Compile, @spec.Turn, @spec.WriteLanes. Drafted in full when P4 starts.
            May change: `packages/flow-state-v3/src/`, the production adapter. Evidence: this
            Task's comments.

            False pass: the adapter doing runtime work → caught by mutants on the adapter.
            Gates: P3's suite, Pay cases; `nub run check`.
